{"seq":4,"slug":"sendable-and-isolation","title":"Sendable 与隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/sendable-and-isolation","wordCount":933,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"sendable-与隔离\">Sendable 与隔离</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Sendable 是 Swift 并发安全的类型级保证（SE-0302）。一个类型遵循 <code>Sendable</code> 协议，表示它的值可以安全地跨并发域传递——跨 actor 边界、跨任务边界。配合 <code>@Sendable</code> 闭包和严格并发检查（Strict Concurrency Checking），Swift 在编译时消除数据竞争。Swift 5.10 进一步引入了基于区域的隔离（Region-based Isolation），完善了并发安全模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S[&quot;Sendable&quot;] --&gt; SP[&quot;Sendable 协议&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; SC[&quot;@Sendable 闭包&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; SCC[&quot;严格并发检查&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; RBI[&quot;基于区域的隔离&quot;]&#10;    SP --&gt; VAL[&quot;值类型自动 Sendable&quot;]&#10;    SP --&gt; CLS[&quot;类需要手动/不可变&quot;]&#10;    SC --&gt; CROSS[&quot;跨隔离边界安全传递&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    S[\"Sendable\"] --&gt; SP[\"Sendable 协议\"]\n    S --&gt; SC[\"@Sendable 闭包\"]\n    S --&gt; SCC[\"严格并发检查\"]\n    S --&gt; RBI[\"基于区域的隔离\"]\n    SP --&gt; VAL[\"值类型自动 Sendable\"]\n    SP --&gt; CLS[\"类需要手动/不可变\"]\n    SC --&gt; CROSS[\"跨隔离边界安全传递\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Sendable 是 Swift 并发安全的<strong>类型级保证</strong>（SE-0302）：一个类型遵循 <code>Sendable</code>，就表示它的值可以安全地跨并发域（actor 边界、任务边界）传递。它相当于给编译器一个承诺，让严格并发检查能在编译期消灭数据竞争。围绕它有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sendable 协议</strong>——标记协议；值类型（struct/enum）在属性都 Sendable 时自动遵循，actor 始终 Sendable，类需显式声明且满足不可变条件；</li>\n<li><strong><code>@Sendable</code> 闭包</strong>——标记闭包可跨并发域使用，禁止捕获可变变量，只能捕获不可变值或 Sendable 值；</li>\n<li><strong>严格并发检查</strong>——<code>minimal</code> / <code>targeted</code> / <code>complete</code> 三级，<code>complete</code> 是 Swift 6 默认；</li>\n<li><strong><code>@unchecked Sendable</code></strong>——绕过编译器检查，由开发者自行保证线程安全；</li>\n<li><strong>基于区域的隔离（Region-based Isolation）</strong>——Swift 5.10+ 的所有权转移分析：值发送后若不再被当前上下文使用，即使非 Sendable 也可安全传递。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>Sendable 承诺值可安全跨界，区域隔离则进一步用「所有权是否转移」放宽这一限制。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"sendable-协议\">Sendable 协议</h2><p><code>Sendable</code> 是一个标记协议（marker protocol），表示类型的值可以在并发域间安全共享：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct Point: Sendable {&#10;    let x: Double&#10;    let y: Double&#10;}&#10;&#10;final class ImmutableConfig: Sendable {&#10;    let apiKey: String&#10;    let timeout: TimeInterval&#10;&#10;    init(apiKey: String, timeout: TimeInterval) {&#10;        self.apiKey = apiKey&#10;        self.timeout = timeout&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImmutableConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apiKey: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timeout: TimeInterval</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apiKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: TimeInterval) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.apiKey </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apiKey</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timeout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动 Sendable 遵循规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>自动 Sendable</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>struct</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>所有存储属性都是 Sendable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>所有关联值都是 Sendable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>actor</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>始终 Sendable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>final class</code></td>\n<td>❌ 需显式</td>\n<td>所有属性不可变且 Sendable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非 final class</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>不能自动遵循</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数/闭包</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>需要 <code>@Sendable</code> 标记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct UserData: Sendable {&#10;    let name: String&#10;    let age: Int&#10;    let tags: [String]&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum NetworkState: Sendable {&#10;    case idle&#10;    case loading&#10;    case loaded(Data)&#10;    case failed(Error)  // ⚠️ Error 不一定 Sendable&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tags: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NetworkState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> loading</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> loaded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> failed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ⚠️ Error 不一定 Sendable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在启用严格并发检查后，传递非 Sendable 类型跨隔离边界会产生编译警告或错误。这是 Swift 6 的默认行为。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sendable-闭包\">@Sendable 闭包</h2><p><code>@Sendable</code> 标记闭包可以安全地在并发环境中使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func processInBackground(&#10;    _ work: @Sendable @escaping () async -&gt; Void&#10;) {&#10;    Task.detached {&#10;        await work()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;actor DataStore {&#10;    var items: [String] = []&#10;&#10;    func process(transform: @Sendable (String) -&gt; String) {&#10;        items = items.map(transform)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processInBackground</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    _</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> work: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Sendable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> @escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Void</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Task.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">detached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> work</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">actor</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Sendable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(transform)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>@Sendable</code> 闭包有严格的捕获规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"var mutableValue = 42&#10;&#10;// ❌ 编译错误：@Sendable 闭包不能捕获可变变量&#10;// Task { print(mutableValue) }&#10;&#10;let immutableValue = 42&#10;Task { print(immutableValue) } // ✅ 捕获不可变值&#10;&#10;let sendableData = UserData(name: &quot;Alice&quot;, age: 30, tags: [])&#10;Task { print(sendableData) } // ✅ 捕获 Sendable 值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mutableValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 编译错误：@Sendable 闭包不能捕获可变变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Task { print(mutableValue) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> immutableValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(immutableValue) } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 捕获不可变值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sendableData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UserData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">age</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendableData) } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 捕获 Sendable 值</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CL[&quot;@Sendable 闭包&quot;] --&gt; CHK{&quot;捕获的值是什么？&quot;}&#10;    CHK --&gt;|不可变值类型| OK1[&quot;✅ 安全&quot;]&#10;    CHK --&gt;|Sendable 类型| OK2[&quot;✅ 安全&quot;]&#10;    CHK --&gt;|可变变量| ERR1[&quot;❌ 编译错误&quot;]&#10;    CHK --&gt;|非 Sendable 引用| ERR2[&quot;❌ 编译错误&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    CL[\"@Sendable 闭包\"] --&gt; CHK{\"捕获的值是什么？\"}\n    CHK --&gt;|不可变值类型| OK1[\"✅ 安全\"]\n    CHK --&gt;|Sendable 类型| OK2[\"✅ 安全\"]\n    CHK --&gt;|可变变量| ERR1[\"❌ 编译错误\"]\n    CHK --&gt;|非 Sendable 引用| ERR2[\"❌ 编译错误\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"严格并发检查\">严格并发检查</h2><p>Swift 提供三个级别的并发检查，通过编译器设置控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Package.swift 中设置&#10;.target(&#10;    name: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;    swiftSettings: [&#10;        .enableExperimentalFeature(&quot;StrictConcurrency&quot;)&#10;    ]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Package.swift 中设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyApp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    swiftSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">enableExperimentalFeature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"StrictConcurrency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>minimal</code></td>\n<td>仅检查显式标记的代码</td>\n<td>初始迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>targeted</code></td>\n<td>检查使用并发特性的代码</td>\n<td>逐步迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>complete</code></td>\n<td>全面检查所有代码</td>\n<td>Swift 6 默认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>常见的并发检查场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"class NonSendableCache {&#10;    var data: [String: Any] = [:]&#10;}&#10;&#10;actor Worker {&#10;    // ❌ complete 模式下：NonSendableCache 不是 Sendable&#10;    // func process(cache: NonSendableCache) { }&#10;&#10;    // ✅ 使用 Sendable 类型&#10;    func process(data: [String: String]) {&#10;        // ...&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NonSendableCache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">actor</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ❌ complete 模式下：NonSendableCache 不是 Sendable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // func process(cache: NonSendableCache) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ✅ 使用 Sendable 类型</span></span